","story_h2_1":"From knitwear to glass,","story_h2_muted":"from glass to structure.","story_paragraphs":["In 2004, As Triko ve Kimya San. Foreign Trade Ltd. Ltd. Our company, which was established as a company, has produced 800,000 pieces per year in the knitwear sector domestically and abroad since its establishment until 2006.","In 2006, due to the bad situation of the knitwear industry in the market, our company continued its path in the glass industry, which was new for it. In this process up to today, our company has sold 310 glass processing machines, glass processing lines and glass silicone materials to all over Turkey. By participating in domestic and international fairs together with the Chinese and Italian branded companies that we distribute, which are number 1 in their countries, As Cam has made its name known to many customers and companies, and has written its name in golden letters in the glass industry.","In 2016, investments began to be made in the construction field; It has formed its new staff for the sales and marketing of bathrooms, kitchens, doors and other similar products, and continues its work rapidly with the aim of bringing a new breath to the sector in this sense."],"story_image":"/uploads/2020/07/fabrika-uretim-8.webp","story_caption":"AS GLASS PRODUCTION FACILITY","software_eyebrow":"OUR DISTRIBUTORS","software_h2":"With brands from China and Italy, which are number 1 in their respective countries.","software_items":["GUANDONG FUSHAN (China) — 10 years of distributorship, 200 machines","IVACO MACHINERY (China) — 7 years of distributorship, 63 machines","BAIYUN (China) — 7-year distributorship, 40,000 barrels","FOREL COMPANY (Italy) — 5-year distributorship, 25 machines","MAPPI COMPANY (Italy) — 5-year distributorship, 22 machines"],"clients_eyebrow":"OUR SOLUTION PARTNERS","clients_h2_1":"Together","clients_h2_accent":"brands we work with.","clients_lead":"","clients":[{"id":"partner-1","name":"Franke","alt":"Franke logosu","url":"#",